.TH DANBY-PEGPENDULUM 1
.SH NAME
danby-pegpendulum \- simulate a pendulum wrapping around a peg
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pegpendulum
.SH DESCRIPTION
When the string contacts the peg, its instantaneous centre of rotation moves to
the peg and its effective length shortens.  The visualization exposes the two
string segments and the plot shows angle and active length.
.PP
Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps while paused,
R resets, and Q exits.
